# The blanket *.json rule above (line ~137) would silently skip the 28-DoF shape
# spec that configs/train/config_g1_dex3.yaml points at. Re-include it AFTER that
# rule, because in gitignore the LAST matching pattern wins.
!configs/train/meta_g1_dex3.json
